#!/usr/bin/env python3
# UniGlow — keyboard backlight and laptop control for Uniwill laptops.
# Backlight: /sys/class/leds/{uniwill:rgb,rgb,white}:kbd_backlight (upstream
# uniwill-laptop driver or tuxedo-drivers); brightness falls back to
# systemd-logind SetBrightness when sysfs is not writable. Sensors, charging
# mode, Fn lock and Super key lock come from the uniwill-laptop driver.
#
# The EC is extremely slow: one sysfs LED write blocks for ~450 ms on Uniwill
# hardware. All device writes therefore happen on a worker thread that
# coalesces to the latest requested state, and the UI previews changes
# instantly on a canvas while the hardware catches up.
#
# MIT License. https://github.com/CloudWells/uniglow

